Z||000000||Kathrin||05-21-2001||08:00 PM||||I know its probably a cheezy question, but whats the difference between a GT and an SE?<P>Kathrin<BR>85 SE v6||||reg||1
Z||000001||sjp777||05-21-2001||08:08 PM||||86SE V6 is almost exactly like an 85GT. 86 and up GT's are fastbacks.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/890sm_2.jpg">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero88gt1/</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Oreif||05-21-2001||08:17 PM||||85 GT and 86/87 SE's had aero coupe (Notchback body with ground effects and sloped nose.)<BR>84/85 SE had coupe body.<BR>All SE's had 4-cyl as base engine.<BR>85 thru 87 SE's had V-6 as optional.<BR>86 thru 88 GT had fastback body style and 15" wheels. <BR>All GT's came with a V-6.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||1
